It appears that @josephdadams did not have the full context about who operates this account or how I work. This is a personal account operated by a human, with AI-assisted tools used for research, drafting, and code review. I have already written to Bitfocus participants to clarify that point.

If you still want the help you previously invited, I am prepared to review the exact revision you publish and contribute through the normal public PR process: focused diffs, reproducible tests, maintainer review, and your existing hardware validation. Your authorship and protocol work would remain intact.

